From: Dmitry Sidorov <dmitry.sidorov@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Oct 2022 22:35:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 48/79] [Backport to 15] [NFC] Remove JointMatrixINTEL W/S
 (#1658)

It's not longer needed after https://github.com/intel/llvm/pull/6535

Signed-off-by: Sidorov, Dmitry <dmitry.sidorov@intel.com>
